tweets.text:
This summer travel season, make sure you know your rights with airlines.

 @USDOT’s dashboard shows you which airlines offer cash compensation, provide travel credits or vouchers, or award frequent flyer miles and cover the cost of other amenities when you experience a flight delay or cancellation that the airline could have prevented.

 https://t.co/dyn0iBeflO

